      <p begin="00:22.620" end="00:24.210" ttm:agent="v1">Like 1, 2</p>
      <p begin="00:24.210" end="00:25.710" ttm:agent="v1">What you try'na do</p>
      <p begin="00:25.350" end="00:26.850" ttm:agent="v1">I got 3, 4</p>
      <p begin="00:26.740" end="00:28.240" ttm:agent="v1">Bitches knocking on my door</p>
      <p begin="00:28.180" end="00:29.680" ttm:agent="v1">But like 5, 6</p>
      <p begin="00:29.650" end="00:31.150" ttm:agent="v1">Baby you so perfect</p>
      <p begin="00:30.890" end="00:34.120" ttm:agent="v1">I don't want these other hoes 'cause these hoes ain't with the shits</p>
      <p begin="00:34.120" end="00:36.580" ttm:agent="v1">But you are, yes you are the one</p>
      <p begin="00:36.580" end="00:39.530" ttm:agent="v1">Count your kisses in the rain and your freckles in the sun</p>
      <p begin="00:39.530" end="00:42.380" ttm:agent="v1">And I think I'm loving you, but I'm loving you too much</p>
      <p begin="00:42.380" end="00:45.550" ttm:agent="v1">But I can treat you right, and then we can make a run</p>
      <p begin="00:45.550" end="00:47.130" ttm:agent="v1">Like 1, 2</p>
