      <p begin="00:53.960" end="00:56.950" ttm:agent="v1">I don't want these other hoes 'cause these hoes ain't with the shits</p>
      <p begin="00:56.950" end="00:59.860" ttm:agent="v1">But you are, yes you are the one</p>
