      <p begin="01:08.330" end="01:11.550" ttm:agent="v1">Like what, aye, 6, 7, 8</p>
      <p begin="01:11.550" end="01:14.340" ttm:agent="v1">I just want your love, and I know I'm super late but</p>
      <p begin="01:14.340" end="01:16.980" ttm:agent="v1">You come from above, and you glisten like a lake but</p>
