      <p begin="01:21.430" end="01:22.930" ttm:agent="v1">Think about you everyday</p>
      <p begin="01:22.740" end="01:25.700" ttm:agent="v1">You said that I would make it but right now todays the day</p>
      <p begin="01:25.700" end="01:28.780" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm dreaming bout your eyes, 'cause your eyes they a-okay but</p>
      <p begin="01:28.780" end="01:31.570" ttm:agent="v1">I can treat you right baby girl and save the day</p>
      <p begin="01:31.570" end="01:33.220" ttm:agent="v1">Like I just want to see you smile</p>
